{"id": "69368", "title": "藏蝶", "author": "倪净", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 17, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69368.htm", "intro": "项西阳，响喻国际的大律师，个性强悍专制， 是个为达目的不择手段的俊雅狂妄男人， 从来只有他不要，没有他要不到的， 更何况只是一位十九岁的天真少女， 明知她是弟弟所爱，执意将这朵温室清莲强摘入口，私自藏匿， 要她从头到脚都属于自己地强夺， 艾宁说他很坏，坏到让她只能任他摆布， 可是她也感受到，他霸道背后的温柔， 直到他无情地拒绝让她拥有他的小孩时， 她发现自己突然好恨他……", "base": "files/article/html/69/69368", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "10616160.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "10616161.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "10616162.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "10616163.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "10616164.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "10616165.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "10616166.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "10616167.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "10616168.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "10616169.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "10616170.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "10616171.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "10616172.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "10616173.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "10616174.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "10616175.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "10616176.html", "available": false}]}